# 图形与 Canvas 绘制

当标准组件无法满足视觉需求——自定义图表、粒子效果、手势绘图、游戏画面——你需要直接操作 Compose 的绘制层。`Canvas` composable 和 `DrawScope` API 提供了像素级的绘制能力，同时保持与 Compose 响应式模型的无缝集成：状态变化自动触发重绘，无需手动 `invalidate()`。

## 核心概念

Compose 的绘制系统分为三个阶段：Composition → Layout → Drawing。`Canvas` composable 跳过了前两个阶段中的大部分工作（无子节点组合、无复杂测量），直接在 Drawing 阶段通过 `DrawScope` 执行绘制命令。

```mermaid
graph LR
    A[Composition 阶段] --> B[Layout 阶段]
    B --> C[Drawing 阶段]
    C --> D[DrawScope]
    D --> E[drawLine / drawCircle / drawPath...]
    D --> F[drawIntoCanvas → 原生 Canvas API]

    subgraph DrawScope 提供
        G[size: Size]
        H[center: Offset]
        I[drawContext: DrawContext]
    end
```

| API 层级                      | 适用场景                   | 示例                         |
| ----------------------------- | -------------------------- | ---------------------------- |
| `Canvas` composable           | 独立的纯绘制区域           | 图表、仪表盘、签名板         |
| `Modifier.drawBehind {}`      | 在现有组件背后绘制         | 自定义背景、阴影             |
| `Modifier.drawWithContent {}` | 控制绘制顺序（前/后/替代） | 遮罩、渐变叠加               |
| `Modifier.drawWithCache {}`   | 缓存绘制中间产物           | 复杂 Path、Brush 预计算      |
| `drawIntoCanvas {}`           | 访问平台原生 Canvas        | 使用 Android Canvas 专属 API |

## Canvas 基础绘制

```kotlin
@Composable
fun PieChart(
    data: List<PieSlice>,
    modifier: Modifier = Modifier
) {
    Canvas(modifier = modifier.size(200.dp)) {
        val total = data.sumOf { it.value.toDouble() }.toFloat()
        var startAngle = -90f  // 从 12 点钟方向开始

        data.forEach { slice ->
            val sweepAngle = 360f * slice.value / total
            drawArc(
                color = slice.color,
                startAngle = startAngle,
                sweepAngle = sweepAngle,
                useCenter = true,
                size = size
            )
            startAngle += sweepAngle
        }
    }
}

data class PieSlice(val label: String, val value: Float, val color: Color)
```

## Path 绘制与贝塞尔曲线

`Path` 是构建复杂形状的基础——折线图、波浪背景、自定义形状裁剪都依赖它：

```kotlin
@Composable
fun LineChart(
    points: List<Float>,
    modifier: Modifier = Modifier,
    lineColor: Color = Color(0xFF6200EE)
) {
    Canvas(modifier = modifier.fillMaxWidth().height(200.dp)) {
        if (points.size < 2) return@Canvas

        val maxValue = points.max()
        val minValue = points.min()
        val range = (maxValue - minValue).coerceAtLeast(1f)

        val stepX = size.width / (points.size - 1)

        val path = Path().apply {
            points.forEachIndexed { index, value ->
                val x = index * stepX
                val y = size.height * (1 - (value - minValue) / range)
                if (index == 0) moveTo(x, y) else lineTo(x, y)
            }
        }

        // 绘制折线
        drawPath(
            path = path,
            color = lineColor,
            style = Stroke(width = 3.dp.toPx(), cap = StrokeCap.Round)
        )

        // 绘制面积填充（渐变）
        val fillPath = Path().apply {
            addPath(path)
            lineTo(size.width, size.height)
            lineTo(0f, size.height)
            close()
        }
        drawPath(
            path = fillPath,
            brush = Brush.verticalGradient(
                colors = listOf(lineColor.copy(alpha = 0.3f), Color.Transparent)
            )
        )
    }
}
```

## drawWithCache：性能关键

频繁重绘时（如动画），在每帧重新创建 `Path`、`Paint`、`Brush` 等对象会增加 GC 压力。`drawWithCache` 让你在参数不变时复用这些中间产物：

```kotlin
@Composable
fun AnimatedWave(phase: Float, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {
    Spacer(
        modifier = modifier
            .fillMaxWidth()
            .height(100.dp)
            .drawWithCache {
                // 这个块只在 size 变化时重新执行
                val wavePath = Path()
                val waveHeight = size.height * 0.3f

                onDrawBehind {
                    // 这个块每帧执行，但复用外层缓存的对象
                    wavePath.reset()
                    wavePath.moveTo(0f, size.height / 2)

                    var x = 0f
                    while (x < size.width) {
                        val y = size.height / 2 +
                            waveHeight * sin((x / size.width * 4 * PI + phase).toFloat())
                        wavePath.lineTo(x, y)
                        x += 2f
                    }

                    drawPath(
                        path = wavePath,
                        color = Color(0xFF03DAC5),
                        style = Stroke(width = 3.dp.toPx())
                    )
                }
            }
    )
}
```

## BlendMode 与图层

Compose 的 `BlendMode` 支持 Porter-Duff 混合模式，配合 `graphicsLayer` 可实现镂空、叠加等高级效果：

```kotlin
@Composable
fun TextMask(text: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {
    Canvas(modifier = modifier.size(300.dp, 100.dp)) {
        // 先绘制渐变背景
        drawRect(
            brush = Brush.horizontalGradient(
                colors = listOf(Color(0xFFFF6B6B), Color(0xFF4ECDC4))
            )
        )
        // 用 DstOut 模式镂空文字区域
        drawContext.canvas.nativeCanvas.apply {
            val paint = android.graphics.Paint().apply {
                textSize = 80f
                typeface = android.graphics.Typeface.DEFAULT_BOLD
                xfermode = android.graphics.PorterDuffXfermode(
                    android.graphics.PorterDuff.Mode.DST_OUT
                )
            }
            drawText(text, 20f, 70f, paint)
        }
    }
}
```

## 与动画系统集成

绘制天然适合与 `Animatable`/`animate*AsState` 配合：

```kotlin
@Composable
fun PulsingDot(modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {
    val infiniteTransition = rememberInfiniteTransition(label = "pulse")
    val scale by infiniteTransition.animateFloat(
        initialValue = 0.8f,
        targetValue = 1.2f,
        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(
            animation = tween(800, easing = FastOutSlowInEasing),
            repeatMode = RepeatMode.Reverse
        ),
        label = "scale"
    )
    val alpha by infiniteTransition.animateFloat(
        initialValue = 1f,
        targetValue = 0.4f,
        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(
            animation = tween(800),
            repeatMode = RepeatMode.Reverse
        ),
        label = "alpha"
    )

    Canvas(modifier = modifier.size(48.dp)) {
        drawCircle(
            color = Color(0xFF6200EE).copy(alpha = alpha),
            radius = size.minDimension / 2 * scale
        )
    }
}
```

## 小结

- `Canvas` composable 提供纯绘制区域，`DrawScope` 是所有绘制命令的执行环境
- `drawWithCache` 在参数不变时缓存中间产物（Path、Brush），避免每帧重建
- `Modifier.drawBehind/drawWithContent` 让任何组件都能附加自定义绘制逻辑
- Path + 贝塞尔曲线是构建图表、波浪、不规则形状的核心工具
- BlendMode 配合图层实现镂空、叠加等混合效果
- 绘制参数绑定到 `animate*AsState`/`InfiniteTransition` 即可实现流畅动画

